      "question": "How can I start clipping on Whop?",
      "answer": "You can start by joining active Content Rewards campaigns on Whop, creating social media accounts on TikTok, YouTube Shorts, X, or Instagram Reels, and downloading the campaign's source footage. Edit the material into short vertical clips, publish them to your accounts, and submit the live post links to Whop for brand review."
