      "question": "Is Whop clipping free?",
      "answer": "Whop does not charge clippers an upfront fee to join Content Rewards campaigns under the terms we reviewed. Whop charges a 10% Content Reward Fee directly to the seller or brand hosting the campaign. Creator payout methods and potential withdrawal fees are not published on Whop's public docs, so check your account settings directly."
    },
